{"id":"1af0375ea8173df2","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems.md","title":"Theorem Inclusions among the Book’s Weak Systems","display":"thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems — Theorem Inclusions among the Book’s Weak Systems","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems","aliases":["92-thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems"],"display":"thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems — Theorem Inclusions among the Book’s Weak Systems","source":"第 V 章 pp. 70–71，Propositions 4–5（PDF 87–88）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction]]","[[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]","[[92-df-provable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems — Theorem Inclusions among the Book’s Weak Systems"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 70–71，Propositions 4–5（PDF 87–88）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9548f0941b8c15ce\" href=\"?note=9548f0941b8c15ce\" title=\"92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction\">92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"920841c1841d30c3\" href=\"?note=920841c1841d30c3\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems\">92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{0,A},R_A,Q_{0,A},Q_A,\\mathrm{PA}_A\">\\(R_{0,A},R_A,Q_{0,A},Q_A,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\)</span> 采用原书的同一无指数公式语法和相同 MP、Gen 规则。</li>\n<li>对这些系统，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}_A(U)\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_A:U\\vdash F\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}_A(U)\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_A:U\\vdash F\\}\\)</span> 为定义目标。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}weak\\text{-}subsystems}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Th}_A(U)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_A:U\\vdash F\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Th}_A(R_{0,A})&amp;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_A(Q_{0,A})\n\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_A(Q_A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_A(\\mathrm{PA}_A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Th}_A(R_{0,A})&amp;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_A(R_A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_A(Q_A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}weak\\text{-}subsystems}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Th}_A(U)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_A:U\\vdash F\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Th}_A(R_{0,A})&amp;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_A(Q_{0,A})\n\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_A(Q_A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_A(\\mathrm{PA}_A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Th}_A(R_{0,A})&amp;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_A(R_A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_A(Q_A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>前一个引理给出每一条 Ω₁–Ω₄ 在 Q₀ 的证明。把 R₀ 证明里的每个算术公理出现换成相应有限 Q₀ 证明，再沿证明行作归纳，得到第一项包含；这里不是声明两个公理集字面包含。Q₀→Q→P.A. 的公理包含直接给出定理包含。Ω₅ 是 Q 的 N9 经数码实例化和变量改名所得，故同样替换 R 的公理证明得到 R→Q。</p>\n<p>这些包含既包括开放公式，也包括句子。没有断言 R、Q₀ 彼此包含；上面的偏序足以传递 Σ₀ 完备性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"9548f0941b8c15ce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems","status":"resolved","id":"920841c1841d30c3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R_{0,A},R_A,Q_{0,A},Q_A,\\mathrm{PA}_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}_A(U)\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_A:U\\vdash F\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}weak\\text{-}subsystems}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Th}_A(U)&\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_A:U\\vdash F\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Th}_A(R_{0,A})&\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_A(Q_{0,A})\n\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_A(Q_A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_A(\\mathrm{PA}_A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Th}_A(R_{0,A})&\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_A(R_A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}_A(Q_A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1746,"backlinks":[{"id":"ea47eabc51d9439c","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 Q₀/Q/R₀/R 的公理三元组现已见 [[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]]，Σ₀ 完备性与定理集包含分别见 [[92-thm-smullyan-weak-sigma0-completeness]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems]]。本文 IΔ₀/IΣ₁ 分类继续作为本地补充，不将其归因为原书。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书弱系统：[[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]] → [[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-weak-sigma0-completeness]] → [[92-cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness]]。[[92-thm-smullyan-r-prime-equivalence]]完成练习8，说明比较模式 Ω₅ 的实际用途。"},{"id":"cf0f2611d5bc4db4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref